Plausible Community Edition
---------------------------
Four ClickHouse configuration files of the Plausible recipe are copied unchanged from
https://github.com/plausible/community-edition (v3.2.1, directory clickhouse/), Copyright (c) 2024
Plausible Analytics, licensed under the MIT License. Their notice and the licence text are in
src/noust/recipes/assets/plausible/NOTICE:

  src/noust/recipes/assets/plausible/clickhouse/*.xml

Fonts of the console
--------------------
The console ships JetBrains Mono (Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors) and Mona Sans
(Copyright 2022 The Mona Sans Project Authors, with Reserved Font Name "Mona"), licensed under the
SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (see LICENSE-OFL-1.1):

  src/noust/web/static/assets/*.woff2

Libraries of the console
------------------------
The console is built from npm packages (React, Base UI, TanStack, lucide, uPlot and others) under the
MIT and ISC licences, which ask for their copyright line and their licence text to travel with every
copy. The build writes both, package by package, from the packages that went into it (a package added,
upgraded or shaken out changes the file with no one remembering to), and the file ships with the
console in every package:

  src/noust/web/static/third-party-licenses.txt

